sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Leader<br/>(holds weights w1, w2)
    participant W as Workers (N shards)

    C->>L: train(iterations)
    L->>W: create shard group

    loop each iteration
        L->>W: compute_gradient(current weights)
        W->>W: fake gradient on local batch
        W-->>L: gradients + latency
        L->>L: average gradients,<br/>update weights (w -= lr * avg)
    end

    L->>L: collect per-node and per-role stats
    L-->>C: final report (timing, samples, efficiency)
